{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.229999542236328,"text":"Pages of notes, accounts, and letters. They show the less romantic side. What the wool cost. Who did not pay. What did not arrive on time. Eva sold her property so that the two festivals could happen. And after that, there was no more money. It is a useful exhibit for a child. Every beautiful thing that got made, got made because somebody sat down and did the sums.","words":[{"word":"Pages","start":0,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"of","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"notes","start":1.559999942779541,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"accounts","start":2.359999895095825,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"and","start":2.4800000190734863,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"letters","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"They","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.9200000762939453},{"word":"show","start":3.9200000762939453,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"the","start":4.199999809265137,"end":4.460000038146973},{"word":"less","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.800000190734863},{"word":"romantic","start":4.800000190734863,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"side","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.659999847412109},{"word":"What","start":6.179999828338623,"end":6.260000228881836},{"word":"the","start":6.260000228881836,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"wool","start":6.659999847412109,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"cost","start":6.659999847412109,"end":7.119999885559082},{"word":"Who","start":7.5,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"did","start":7.599999904632568,"end":7.800000190734863},{"word":"not","start":7.800000190734863,"end":7.980000019073486},{"word":"pay","start":7.980000019073486,"end":8.260000228881836},{"word":"What","start":8.739999771118164,"end":8.899999618530273},{"word":"did","start":8.899999618530273,"end":9.079999923706055},{"word":"not","start":9.079999923706055,"end":9.34000015258789},{"word":"arrive","start":9.34000015258789,"e